# Solana Anchor Rules

- Target program: `kite-vault` in `packages/anchor/programs/kite-vault`.
- Framework: Anchor 0.30.1.
- Solana Agave CLI 3.1.10.
- All instructions must validate account constraints (e.g. `has_one`, `seeds`, `bump`, `constraint`).
- Handle errors with explicit codes from `errors.rs`.
- Run tests with `export PATH="$HOME/.cargo/bin:$HOME/.local/share/solana/install/active_release/bin:$PATH" && anchor test`.
